// player.vehicle
// {
// 	bool canEnterFlight = true;
// }

// Per-vehicle blacklist.
//
// Setting `flightDisabled = true` on a vehicle record keeps Let There Be Flight from
// attaching anything to that vehicle (no flight component, no thruster meshes, no extra
// slots or colliders, no flight HUD). Use it for vehicles that crash on enter or when a
// CrystalCoat color is applied (see docs/crystalcoat-crash-analysis.md).
//
// Nothing is disabled by default. To disable a vehicle without editing this file, drop
// a yaml into r6/tweaks/, e.g. r6/tweaks/ltbf_blacklist.yaml:
//
//   Vehicle.v_sport1_rayfield_caliburn_player:
//     flightDisabled: true
//
// or the same in native tweak syntax (r6/tweaks/ltbf_blacklist.tweak):
//
//   Vehicle.v_sport1_rayfield_caliburn_player { bool flightDisabled = true; }
//
// Record names: the vehicle's TweakDB record (Vehicle.<name>), the same name used for the
// thrusterMesh / thrusterAppearance overrides in vehicles.tweak. `canEnterFlight = false`
// on a record has the same effect and is kept for older configs.
//
// Per-vehicle whitelist.
//
// `canEnterFlight = true` is the opt-in half of the same flag. With Mod Settings >
// Let There Be Flight > General Flight Settings > Flight Availability set to
// "Whitelist Only", only records carrying it can be flown; every other vehicle keeps its
// flight component but the toggle, its input hint and the flight quickhacks are not offered.
// In the default "All Vehicles" mode the flag only re-enables a record that something else
// turned off. Example r6/tweaks/my_flight_whitelist.yaml:
//
//   Vehicle.v_sport2_quadra_type66_player:
//     canEnterFlight: true
//   Vehicle.v_sport1_rayfield_caliburn_player:
//     canEnterFlight: true
//
// Vehicles reported crashing with CrystalCoat on 2.3 / 2.31 (uncomment to disable):
//
// Vehicle.v_sport1_rayfield_caliburn_player { bool flightDisabled = true; }
// Vehicle.v_sport1_rayfield_aerondight_player { bool flightDisabled = true; }
// Vehicle.v_sport2_porsche_911turbo_player { bool flightDisabled = true; }
// Vehicle.v_sport2_quadra_type66_02_player { bool flightDisabled = true; }
